{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_adr_0017_studio_primacy_tool_census_gate_adr_0017", "label": "ADR-0017: Studio primacy \u2014 phase-10 tool census is the port acceptance gate", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/0017-studio-primacy-tool-census-gate.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The 3D Design Studio is the flagship and nothing is compromised against it. The POC studio is real working engineering that D39 ruled is kept and refactored, never redesigned; the risk in any port is silent capability loss, so the census makes loss auditable rather than trusting 'looks complete'."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0017_studio_primacy_tool_census_gate_phase10_tool_census", "label": "Phase-10 tool census as merge gate", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0017-studio-primacy-tool-census-gate.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Screens 10.1\u201310.11 are a binding acceptance checklist: every tool and computed output survives, and a port slice is not done until its census rows are checked against the running app \u2014 on par with typecheck/lint."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0017_studio_primacy_tool_census_gate_webview_studio_mobile", "label": "Authenticated seamless WebView studio on mobile", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0017-studio-primacy-tool-census-gate.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "D2 full parity is met by responsive web at 375px; native canvas editing is not rebuilt, so one studio codebase instead of two. Cost: the studio is not offline on mobile in v1 and needs a session bridge; low-end Android performance is a verification item, not an assumption."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0017_studio_primacy_tool_census_gate_studio_last_build_order", "label": "Amendment: studio port is the LAST major build phase (Track D)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0017-studio-primacy-tool-census-gate.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Owner rev-2 directive: with a validated POC in hand the greenfield SaaS surfaces (CRM, billing, proposals, customer link) are the scarcer launch value. The move is in TIME only \u2014 refactor targets and honesty systems stand unchanged; Launch-1 sells on Path B proposals plus remote survey."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0017_studio_primacy_tool_census_gate_touch_first_refactor_targets", "label": "Touch-first refactor targets", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0017-studio-primacy-tool-census-gate.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Mode-based canvas instead of modifier keys, pinch-zoom and two-finger pan on 2D, visible labels instead of hover, large tap targets replacing ~9px handles, progressive disclosure for the BOM's ~286 controls."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0017_studio_primacy_tool_census_gate_honesty_systems", "label": "Honesty systems travel with the port", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0017-studio-primacy-tool-census-gate.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Provenance labels, PVGIS-vs-estimate distinction, structure as material modelling only, and human engineer sign-off remain intact through the refactor."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0017_studio_primacy_tool_census_gate_375px_contract", "label": "375px is a hard UI contract", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0017-studio-primacy-tool-census-gate.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every studio screen must genuinely work at 375px \u2014 an aspiration would silently reintroduce a reduced mobile studio."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0017_studio_primacy_tool_census_gate_native_rn_canvas_studio", "label": "Rejected: native RN canvas studio", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0017-studio-primacy-tool-census-gate.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Duplicates a ~40-module engineering core plus renderer on a second platform; guaranteed permanent parity drift."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0017_studio_primacy_tool_census_gate_reduced_mobile_studio", "label": "Rejected: reduced mobile studio (viewer only)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0017-studio-primacy-tool-census-gate.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Violates D2 full parity and the nothing-compromised directive."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0017_studio_primacy_tool_census_gate_redesign_from_scratch", "label": "Rejected: redesign the studio from scratch", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0017-studio-primacy-tool-census-gate.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Superseded by D39 \u2014 the geometry/engineering/code carry over and the phase-10 file is a refactor checklist, not a redesign brief."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0017_studio_primacy_tool_census_gate_studio_first_launch1", "label": "Rejected: studio first in Launch-1", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0017-studio-primacy-tool-census-gate.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The original sequencing, superseded by the owner's rev-2 priority directive."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0017_studio_primacy_tool_census_gate_cutting_studio_scope", "label": "Rejected: cutting studio scope to fit an earlier slot", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0017-studio-primacy-tool-census-gate.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Rejected outright \u2014 the census gate exists precisely to prevent this; the release valve is non-census scope elsewhere."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0009_offline_sync_powersync_adr_0009", "label": "ADR-0009: Offline sync (PowerSync)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/0017-studio-primacy-tool-census-gate.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_14_build_roadmap_build_roadmap", "label": "docs/14 \u2014 build roadmap (cross-module plan of record)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/0017-studio-primacy-tool-census-gate.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_adr_0017_studio_primacy_tool_census_gate_adr_0017", "target": "docs_adr_0017_studio_primacy_tool_census_gate_phase10_tool_census", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0017-studio-primacy-tool-census-gate.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0017_studio_primacy_tool_census_gate_adr_0017", "target": "docs_adr_0017_studio_primacy_tool_census_gate_webview_studio_mobile", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0017-studio-primacy-tool-census-gate.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0017_studio_primacy_tool_census_gate_studio_last_build_order", "target": "docs_adr_0017_studio_primacy_tool_census_gate_adr_0017", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0017-studio-primacy-tool-census-gate.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0017_studio_primacy_tool_census_gate_studio_last_build_order", "target": "docs_14_build_roadmap_build_roadmap", "relation"